---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getHreflangStaticPaths } from "../lib/hreflang-helpers";
import { localePath } from "../utils/base";
import { t } from "../i18n/ui";
import { EDITOR, HOST, LEGAL_UPDATED } from "../config/legal";
import type { Locale } from "../i18n/config";

const locale: Locale = "en";
const lp = (path: string) => localePath(path, locale);
const h2 = "font-display text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3";
const link = "text-brand-600 hover:text-brand-800 font-medium";
---

<Layout title="Legal Notices | WizyQuiz, Free Online Quizzes" description="WizyQuiz legal notices: site publisher, hosting provider, publication director, intellectual property and governing law." locale={locale} hreflangPaths={getHreflangStaticPaths("legal")}>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500 mb-8" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href={lp("/")} class="hover:text-brand-600 transition-colors font-medium">{t(locale, "breadcrumb.home")}</a>
      <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-gray-300" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      <span class="text-gray-700 font-semibold">Legal Notices</span>
    </nav>

    <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-8">Legal Notices</h1>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
      <p>These notices are published under article 6-III of French law no. 2004-575 of June 21, 2004 on confidence in the digital economy (known as the LCEN).</p>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>1. Site publisher</h2>
        <p>The <strong>WizyQuiz</strong> website, available at https://wizyquiz.com, is published in a personal capacity by:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 mt-2">
          <li><strong>Name:</strong> {EDITOR.name}, private individual</li>
          {EDITOR.address && <li><strong>Address:</strong> {EDITOR.address}</li>}
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href={`mailto:${EDITOR.email}`} class={link}>{EDITOR.email}</a></li>
          {EDITOR.phone && <li><strong>Phone:</strong> {EDITOR.phone}</li>}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>2. Publication director</h2>
        <p>The publication director is {EDITOR.name}, who can be reached at {EDITOR.email}.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>3. Hosting provider</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
          <li><strong>Company name:</strong> {HOST.name}</li>
          <li><strong>Address:</strong> {HOST.addressEn}</li>
          <li><strong>Phone:</strong> {HOST.phone}</li>
          <li><strong>Website:</strong> <a href={HOST.site} class={link} rel="noopener">cloudflare.com</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-2">The site and its database run on Cloudflare's servers (Workers and D1).</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>4. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>The site's texts, the questions, answers and their explanations, the WizyQuiz name and logo, the visual design and the code belong to {EDITOR.name}. Copying them, in whole or in part, without written permission is not allowed.</p>
        <p class="mt-2">The photos and visuals used in the quizzes (posters, screenshots, press photos, etc.) remain the property of their authors and rights holders. The names of films, series, games and brands mentioned belong to their owners, and WizyQuiz is not affiliated with any of them. If you hold the rights to an image and would like it credited or removed, write to {EDITOR.email} and the request will be handled as quickly as possible.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>5. Content published by players</h2>
        <p>Quizzes created by players are published under their own responsibility. They are not shown in the site's catalog and are not indexed by search engines. Illegal content can be reported to {EDITOR.email}, with the address of the page. It is removed as soon as it is reported, as provided for by article 6-I-2 of the LCEN.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>6. Personal data and cookies</h2>
        <p>The data collected and your rights are set out in the <a href={lp("/privacy-policy")} class={link}>privacy policy</a>. The only cookie the site sets is described on the <a href={lp("/cookies")} class={link}>cookies</a> page.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>7. Liability</h2>
        <p>The quizzes are there to play and to learn. A mistake can slip into a question or an explanation: if you spot one, write to {EDITOR.email} and it will be corrected.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class={h2}>8. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These notices are governed by French law. In the event of a dispute, and after an attempt to settle it amicably, the French courts have jurisdiction.</p>
      </section>

      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">Last updated: {LEGAL_UPDATED.en}</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
